<title>USA: Vector says firm takes majority stake.</title>
<headline>Vector says firm takes majority stake.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Aeromotive Corp said Thursday Tradelink International Ltd, a private company has acquired a majority stake in it as the result of a share purchase agreement.</p>
<p>It did not disclose details of the share purchase agreement.</p>
<p>As a consequence of the share purchase agreement, Vector said it has restructured its board to include Tradelink's nominees and give it a majority position on the new Board.</p>
<p>The new directors are W. Randall Welty and Timothy Enright, and David Kordek.</p>
</text>
